<description>&lt;p&gt;Construction vehicles were torched in Yala while attacks continued in three southern provinces, prompting a border policy review that placed ten border provinces on alert and prepared evacuation centres for possible refugees. The Thai foreign minister travelled to Myanmar for talks with Min Aung Hlaing over border security, and Thailand challenged Myanmar about arsenic-tainted rivers affecting cross-border water. Thai forces deployed F‑16s to the Tak border as part of the response. The insurgency now includes disputes over water contamination alongside traditional violence. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPYko2TXRuRkZsdy04WmdzaW95MzJCTjdfVjFiS1llRGEzOHJCbWpXS1ZTcFJNeS1RVlNRN1RDd2F6OVdYeTVBaHNITWFJX3ZPRkdwVDhiV0tsOFk1eEk3ZkZUSFVnTTN5Tm9pa05qQWZuaUFuYWhGbW5PekxvRGxkUTJfT0VzTmU2Q2VZLVJtd2E3cXVrdml2WjdISkJtNWV5eXZDS2pQc1c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Daily Dazzling Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOS2dxa3BjSXFxcktBbjFhbkZYNEVhMVdYMjFUeDZwSUNfZUluRDJpODlBem9OQU9QZVhIXzN1V3g3RVJoREVVSkg4b0RKSTg3ZTZ2TS1PWFlKQU9kNUgtN3hWa2d5NUE0R0xOVnJDV3VhM2ltRklMMkx5d3lpU1Bza0JnVXdxczVDNFdfRmFWcjR1RElpUTF5dm5DTm1FblYyMTdNdGRUTGJ6TVJUT3h1TTB3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNT2t6UFZhUUZNQm9FMF9ZWVBhRVdHVDFNWVlQSjdoUHp6dGp5WWlWOHRTS2M2aU1MaFZWQVdwaUhaU2lMWUtLbFk4bWwwaXl2dDd0TnJ6UUctWGIwaDJab1l5d29WUnNKWjEyeEZhSVI1UFRoUFYxNVZ3RkdSQzlyV3E1bG1lVEtKbXFxVDBhcjl1VTQwcGFxdDBrTy1UbU5qOUhvQ05oeWQzaV9vUlRuUEhDYVZucW4zbkoyd3hXeUlsdDJJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxPUEZtNUtEU0VWd3RzZ1BWU0J3RkVSekM1TWRtcWMxOF81Z0Q1TEhJck5PZXJhUVRUMllUaXJKUExocEcyb2tOdndnbkMwVWhDMFpK